OL,3,GNEWSAMan due in court over #7,000
OL,4,Ahedgehog statue theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been summoned to court
OL,7,Fcharged with the alleged theft of a
OL,8,F#7,000 hedgehog statue.
OL,10,FMark McNeil, 62, of Shepherd's Bush
OL,11,FRoad, London is accused of taking the
OL,12,Fbronze sculpture from the Gladwell and
OL,13,FPatterson Art Gallery in Stamford in
OL,14,FAugust 2025.
OL,16,FLincolnshire Police said: "Despite
OL,17,Fproving to be a prickly investigation,
OL,18,Fofficers remained on the trail and
OL,19,Fensured the investigation did not go
OL,20,Finto hibernation".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
